{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25218","headline":"姑熟杂咏 灵墟山 · 李赤","name":"姑熟杂咏 灵墟山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丁令辞世人，拂衣向仙路。\n伏链九丹成，方随五云去。\n松萝蔽幽洞，桃杏深隐处。\n不知曾化鹤，辽海归几度。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李赤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25218.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25218","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}